cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this research program, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "FACET: Fuel-Adaptive Control Evidence & Transferability — research program, portfolio and evidence log"
abstract: >-
  An independent research program on fuel-property-adaptive fuel injection control for
  heavy-duty and off-highway compression-ignition engines, and on the verification
  evidence and cross-program applicability criteria that would allow such control to
  reach production. Contains the program statement, the project register, the evidence
  log and the program page.
authors:
